export anchor SynthwaveStyle:
    number: 262
    screen: DesignEditor
    name: Synthwave
    idea: A retro future night drive, where the frame floats over a striped sunset sun and a cyan perspective grid, neon magenta and cyan outlines trace the panels, and the inspector runs as a single property strip under the horizon.
    base: dark
    palette:
        night: #0d0221, the page and the top of the sky
        panel: #170a33, the header, layers, the property strip and the style sheet
        deep: #0a0119, fields, tools and the status readout
        selected: #2c0e4a, the selected layer behind a magenta line
        line: #3a1f6e, idle outlines and underlines
        ink: #f6eaff, text
        haze: #c4b3e6, meta and labels
        neonMagenta: #ff4fd8, the layers outline, Share, the selected row and field keys
        neonCyan: #3ff0ff, the active tool, the grid floor, the frame outline, handles and focus
        sunGold: #ffb347, the sun top and the version readout
        sunPink: #ff2e88, the sun bottom and the logo
        guide: #c0157f, the 32 px guide with white text
    type:
        Titles in Arial Black, Segoe UI Black, Helvetica Neue at 900 italic in
        caps. Text in system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto. Readouts, tools and keys in
        ui-monospace. The file name is 18px italic caps, panel titles 16px
        italic caps with a neon glow, layer names 14px 650, values 14px mono,
        readouts 12px mono and group labels 11px 700 mono caps tracked 0.1em.
    layout:
        A header panel with a magenta bottom line holds a skewed sunset
        gradient BW logo, CANVAS · WEBSITE REDESIGN in cyan mono over HOME V3,
        a row of six outlined tool buttons with mono names, Move glowing cyan,
        a magenta 66%, outlined square avatars in magenta, cyan and gold, a
        cyan outlined Present and a solid magenta Share. Below sit a 268px
        left column and a wide right. The left is a magenta neon panel with
        the layers, cyan kind icons, names and mono sub lines, Hero outlined
        in magenta with a Selected tag, and at its foot a status readout
        listing Saved 2 minutes ago in cyan, 3 people editing in magenta and
        Version 41 in gold. The right holds the stage, a sky gradient with a
        large striped gold to pink sun and a cyan grid floor in perspective,
        with the white Hero frame centred over it at up to 600px, a glowing
        cyan outline and diamond handles. Under the stage a cyan neon property
        strip lays out five cells in one row, Position / size, Fill, Auto
        layout Vertical, Radius and Export with Export Hero, each with magenta
        keys and underlined mono values. Below 860px the stage comes first,
        the strip wraps to two columns and the tools become a fixed bottom
        bar.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 16px between panels, 48px around the frame on the stage, 10px between strip cells.
    density: Medium, with layers and the readout on the left and all properties in one strip.
    corners: Tight. 6px panels, 4px controls and rows, diamonds for handles.
    borders: 1.5px neon outlines, magenta around layers, cyan around properties and dim violet for idle controls.
    shadows: Neon glows only, 10 to 24px in the line colour, never a dark drop shadow.
    icons:
        Line icons at 1.8px stroke, 18px, in cyan. Selected is a circled
        check, Collapsed a right chevron, Saved a cloud with a check, always
        with the word.
    focus: A 2px cyan outline offset 3px with a cyan glow.
    tone: Arcade cabinet, with italic caps titles and mono caps readouts such as Position / size.
